# Research inputs, deliberately not redistributed.
#
# src/Photos holds screenshots of utilityconnect.net taken while auditing their
# public routes; src/Videos holds their own marketing videos. No code imports
# either one. They are Utility Connect's assets, not ours, and this repository
# is not affiliated with them - so the audit in research/ cites them by public
# URL rather than shipping copies.
src/Photos/
src/Videos/

# Working notes for the AI assistant on this repository.
#
# Kept out of the published tree deliberately. It is a planning document, not
# documentation: it carries an internal delivery deadline, framing about another
# company written as guardrails rather than as claims, and a line recording which
# of the author's own prior projects are still pending evidence. All of that is
# useful while building and misleading to a reader who finds it in a public repo.
#
# What it governs is visible anyway, in the places that matter: the AI boundaries
# are enforced by a CHECK constraint and a fitness test, and the honesty tiers are
# labelled on every screen.
CLAUDE.md

# Impeccable's local state. The skill itself is committed; its per-session
# scratch and harness-local settings are not.
.claude/settings.local.json
